// Casa Chorizo — Traditional Argentine row house
// Long narrow lot, rooms in a line along the party wall (west),
// galería (covered gallery) for circulation, and open patio (east).
// Typical of Buenos Aires, La Plata, and other Argentine cities (1880–1940).

plan: "Casa Chorizo"

floor: "Planta Baja"

